//│           infer EVar(a)
//│           OK δ ⇝ ∅
//│           constrain ∀α, β, γ ◁ {α ≤ (Int ▷ {γ ≥ Int, β ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ▷ {γ ≥ Str, β ≤ Str}), β ≤ (Int ▷ {γ ≥ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ▷ {γ ≥ Str, α ≤ Str}), γ ≥ (Int ▷ {β ≤ Int, α ≤ Int}) ∨ (Str ▷ {β ≤ Str, α ≤ Str})}. α → β → γ ≤ δ → ι
